;Description
:This template is used to link to an Threads account.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Threads|<username>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Threads Profile link without handle (without '@'). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Threads|biribiristockin0816|stungun threads description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Threads|biribiristockin0816|stungun threads description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

